13
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:35,000
If you think you can stop me, then go ahead and try, Sosu!

14
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:37,000
And I want to get all of this stuff cut.

15
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Let's do!

16
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Let's do!

17
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Let's do!

