218
00:11:36,618 --> 00:11:38,118
Did Red get left too?

219
00:11:39,118 --> 00:11:40,598
Take a look around.

220
00:11:41,878 --> 00:11:42,638
Hey.

221
00:11:43,998 --> 00:11:47,878
Riko, I'm sorry.

222
00:11:48,458 --> 00:11:50,018
I'm ashamed of myself.

223
00:11:50,238 --> 00:11:52,918
While I made you do something dangerous.

224
00:11:53,598 --> 00:11:56,018
I wasn't able to stop Fapta's rampage.

225
00:11:56,798 --> 00:11:57,318
Irredeemable.

226
00:11:57,718 --> 00:11:59,598
It's not worth letting that bother you.

227
00:11:59,998 --> 00:12:02,238
But just look at the state of the village now.

228
00:12:02,418 --> 00:12:06,798
You know, none of us think that you three kids are responsible for any of this.

229
00:12:06,798 --> 00:12:12,158
I found out how the village came to be, and I heard Fapta's voice loud and clear.

230
00:12:12,158 --> 00:12:19,398
You see, long ago, a little girl found herself in a nightmare, trying to awaken for what felt

231
00:12:19,398 --> 00:12:22,498
like an eternity, and now that time has come.

232
00:12:22,778 --> 00:12:25,318
Kaja always knew this day would come.

233
00:12:25,698 --> 00:12:26,818
Misuke so too.

234
00:12:27,278 --> 00:12:28,918
Kaome also said so.

235
00:12:28,918 --> 00:12:31,378
