236
00:12:32,378 --> 00:12:36,658
Anyway, we originally set out to have an extraordinary adventure.

237
00:12:37,258 --> 00:12:40,518
But it's like, what have we been doing with ourselves all this time?

238
00:12:41,218 --> 00:12:41,478
Hmm.

239
00:12:41,478 --> 00:12:47,478
Well, if you want more details about that, you should ask the one who incited you all into this.

240
00:12:47,478 --> 00:12:57,378
Hello there.

241
00:12:57,818 --> 00:12:59,078
I see you're all here.

242
00:12:59,938 --> 00:13:00,378
Great.

243
00:13:00,658 --> 00:13:01,638
I'm so glad.

244
00:13:02,198 --> 00:13:03,958
But I'll be taking my leave now.

245
00:13:04,858 --> 00:13:06,578
I'm beat and weary.

246
00:13:07,478 --> 00:13:08,538
Oh, Mugi.

247
00:13:08,998 --> 00:13:10,578
Saying I incited them.

248
00:13:11,058 --> 00:13:12,118
Isn't that kind of mean?

249
00:13:12,118 --> 00:13:17,218
This is the result of everyone caring for each other and taking action.

250
00:13:17,858 --> 00:13:20,418
It occurred through an accumulation of deeds.

251
00:13:21,438 --> 00:13:24,118
That may be true, but I still find it maddening.

252
00:13:24,958 --> 00:13:25,238
Riko.

253
00:13:26,558 --> 00:13:28,398
There's something I must ask you.

254
00:13:29,318 --> 00:13:30,898
Are you glad you came here?

255
00:13:33,498 --> 00:13:35,398
I'm super glad I came here.

256
00:13:35,398 --> 00:13:44,378
If I had continued to live up on the surface and hadn't set my sights on the bottom of the netherworld, I never would have seen this place.

257
00:13:44,858 --> 00:13:48,158
I couldn't possibly imagine this would exist in the absolute boundary.

258
00:13:48,678 --> 00:13:51,238
Or that such wonderful individuals lived here.

259
00:13:51,798 --> 00:13:54,638
That's why I'm happy I made it down here.

260
00:13:57,138 --> 00:13:58,138
Say, what's it, Kion?

261
00:13:58,638 --> 00:13:58,978
Hmm?

262
00:13:58,978 --> 00:14:03,358
You know, I actually had that compass until a short time ago.

263
00:14:03,898 --> 00:14:04,378
