270
00:14:19,278 --> 00:14:21,018
But that's really, really great.

271
00:14:21,198 --> 00:14:24,958
Wazu-kyan, so what was your endgame, anyway?

272
00:14:24,958 --> 00:14:29,358
Nanachi, I see Belov's wishes were passed on to you.

273
00:14:29,698 --> 00:14:30,998
