274
00:14:32,138 --> 00:14:36,638
You see, we wanted to become something beyond human.

275
00:14:37,858 --> 00:14:42,778
To penetrate this giant pit, one must surpass humanity altogether.

276
00:14:43,358 --> 00:14:49,578
That means, as a resident of the netherworld, becoming a hollow, being blessed and gaining power,

277
00:14:50,258 --> 00:14:52,998
